Stopped recording a change log entry for an IP Fabric object the sync found unchanged. An object IP Fabric still reports exactly as Nautobot holds it is stamped with one update of its custom field data rather than a full save, so its `last_synced_from_sor` date still moves but its Change Log tab now shows the runs that changed something rather than one entry per run. An object the sync does change is written in full, with validation and a change log entry, as before.
